.\" Predator Sense Linux
.TH PSENSE 1 "2026-10-18" "predator-sense 5.0.1463" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
psense \- CLI client for the Predator Sense Linux daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B psense
.I subcommand
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
CLI client for
.BR psensed (8).
All commands talk JSON over the daemon unix socket
.IR /run/psense.sock ,
which is owned root:wheel 0660 \- wheel users run this CLI without sudo.
All privileged EC/WMI work happens in the daemon, never in the CLI.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B sensors
Fan RPM and temperatures as JSON (hwmon-sourced, 2 s cache).
.TP
.B info
Platform/tooling state: DMI product, kernel, hwmon and WMI device inventory.
.TP
.B profile get | list | set NAME
Thermal/scenario profile (maps to the platform-profile sysfs and the
Acer gaming-scenario WMI surface).
.TP
.B fan status | mode | speed | reset | sweep
HWmon fan control (per-fan mode/pwm via acer\-wmi force_caps).
.TP
.BI fan " wmode ID | wspeed " FAN " PCT | wget | wmodes | wtable"
WMI fan-table surface (raw percent/level writes, raw table read).
.TP
.B fan curve set --fan FAN --points "T:P ..."
.B / fan curve show | clear
Userspace temp\(enpercent curves with hysteresis, interpreted by the daemon.
.TP
.B kb get | zone I R,G,B | set LIGHTMODE BRIGHTNESS --rgb R,G,B
Keyboard backlight and per-zone colors via the WMI keyboard surface.
.TP
.B battmode get | set MODE
Battery charge mode via the BatteryControl WMI surface (GUID begins
79772EC5; see spec/protocol.md §5 in the source tree).  Modes: optimized,
full, adaptive (adaptive is rejected by the EC on this machine and
reported honestly, never faked).
.TP
.BI wmi " GUID_TAG MID [HEXBYTES] [\-\-out N]"
Raw whitelisted WMI method call through the daemon (allow-masked by
GUID and method id \- undocumented vendor surfaces are not callable).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /run/psense.sock
daemon JSON API socket
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR psensed (8),
.BR predator-sense (1)
.SH BUGS
Adaptive/AI\-Smart charging is hidden on machines where the EC rejects the
adaptive function (reported honestly, not silently ignored).  Send issues
against the predator\-sense\-linux project.
